mails a month on Instantly.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "This covers list hygiene, sender reputation and deliverability. It is the same setup Lorenzo uses to send over 100,000 cold emails a month on Instantly.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_33", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2738, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_34", "type": "text", "x": 2760, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - SEQUENCES WITH TWO GOALS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - SEQUENCES WITH TWO GOALS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 2760, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "This covers the campaigns, the testing and the two goals in your post. Each campaign either books a meeting or sends people to subscribe\nonline.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "This covers the campaigns, the testing and the two goals in your post. Each campaign either books a meeting or sends people to subscribe\nonline.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_36", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3986, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_37", "type": "text", "x": 4008, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - TRACKING AND HAND-OFF", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - TRACKING AND HAND-OFF", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_38", "type": "text", "x": 4008, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "This covers tracking and the hand-off to your team. Your Technical Sales Executive or\nfounders only get the conversations that need a product discussion.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "This covers tracking and the hand-off to your team. Your Technical Sales Executive or\nfounders only get the conversations that need a product discussion.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_39", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4884, "y": -134, "width": 352, "height": 262, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_40", "type": "text", "x": 4906, "y": -118, "width": 308, "height": 55, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1222328496, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1656961616, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - OPTIMISE FROM THE\nRESULTS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - OPTIMISE FROM THE\nRESULTS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_41", "type": "text", "x": 4906, "y": -54, "width": 308, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId":